<title>BELGIUM: Belgian bankruptcies up 1.5 pct yr/yr in June.</title>
<headline>Belgian bankruptcies up 1.5 pct yr/yr in June.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company bankruptcies in Belgium rose by 10, or 1.5 percent, to 651 in June compared with June 1996, Belgian trade and company data group Infotrade said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>In the first half of 1997 a total of 4,096 companies went bankrupt, up from 3,759 in the same 1996 period.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
